{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11309420","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11309420","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1130942001:1":{"text":"脚を怪我したバードマウントだよ！前にボクが助けてあげたの！","source_cn":"一只脚上有伤的陆行鸟！我之前救过它！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x747E2EB3E1D2CEF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130942002:1":{"text":"すごくおとなしくて、少し臆病な鳥なんだ。人を見るとすぐに逃げ出しちゃって、他のバードマウントとケンカすることもなかった。","source_cn":"它特别温顺，胆子也很小，看到人就立刻跑开，也不敢和其他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2675903393775895","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130942003:1":{"text":"でも今日、果物をあげようと思って会いに来たら、他の動物とケンカしてるの！","source_cn":"可是今天，我拿着水果来看它的时候，它在和其他动物打成一团！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C89313FAEE34103","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1130942004:1":{"text":"しかも、その姿は……もうボクが知ってるククアじゃなかった。ボクを見るなり、口を開けて突進してきたんだ！","source_cn":"而且，它变得好凶哦……好像不认识我了一样，张着嘴向我扑过来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44C2B4FE9B29B44B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1130942005:1":{"text":"ボ、ボクは怖くなって逃げ出しちゃったんだ……もう一回確かめに戻ると、ククアはもういなくなってた……","source_cn":"我、我太害怕，逃走了……再回来看时，库库亚也不见了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27B798F65E0E5B83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:蛮血陶拉贡":{"text":"ババリアのトラゴン","source":"蛮血陶拉贡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":1}}